'''Iceblaster''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It resembles a revolver, but with the barrel being encased with ice. It is mainly purple, with icy blue highlights on the cylinder, and a silver trigger and highlight going into the ice that encases the barrel.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife [[Icebreaker]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ice Set|Ice Set]].
* It has [[Unique Weapons|unique]] variants that were given as leaderboard trophies during [[Christmas Event 2020]] - [[Red Iceblaster]], [[Bronze Iceblaster]], [[Silver Iceblaster]], [[Gold Iceblaster]].
* This was the fourth [[Godly Weapons|godly]] [[Guns|gun]] in a row in a holiday box.

